@startuml Clinic Cancellation
title Clinic Cancellation
note top
Summary: Shows doctor/admin and staff cancellation permissions and the resulting agenda updates.
end note

actor "Doctor / Admin" as Doctor
actor Staff
participant "Booking App" as App
participant "Auth and Access" as Auth
participant "Shared Scheduling Service" as Schedule
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

alt Doctor/admin cancels a visit
    Doctor -> App: Cancel from agenda with reason and optional block/rebooking instruction
    App -> Auth: Check admin session
    Auth -> Schedule: Authorize cancellation and admin options
else Staff cancels clinic-created visit
    Staff -> App: Cancel future confirmed clinic-created visit with reason
    App -> Auth: Check staff session and appointment origin
    Auth -> Schedule: Authorize allowed staff cancellation
end
Schedule -> DB: Lock doctor, cancel, release or block time, audit atomically
DB --> Schedule: Cancellation committed
Schedule --> App: Cancelled appointment and saved reason
App --> Doctor: Update agenda and cancelled history
App --> Staff: Update agenda and cancelled history
note over Doctor, Schedule: Automatic cancellation email is planned. No cancellation notice is sent in the current implementation.
@enduml
